WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:08.900
For forty years, LaoZhou has been making Chinese tofu snacks
with one simple idea: let the craft do the talking.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:21.900
Today, that experience moves into a new intelligent factory,
built around digital control, automation and consistent standards.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:38.700
Every stage, from handling the raw ingredients to seasoning and packing,
is coordinated through one connected system.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:48.600
Production begins with PLC-controlled forming,
regulated and measured on a central digital platform.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:01.000
A different way to make a familiar food.
Efficiency goes up. The character of the tofu stays the same.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:16.200
Every piece of LaoZhou high-broth tofu
passes through fifteen standardized steps.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:28.500
We select soybeans, soak them in temperature-controlled water,
and grind them on ceramic stone mills.

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:31.000
Low-pressure cooking preserves the bean's aroma.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:37.700
On a PLC-controlled line, the slurry is formed,
pressed and dewatered automatically.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:45.300
A controlled high-temperature fry builds the golden outside.
Then each pack is vacuum sealed and sterilized.

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:51.200
Safe, stable and ready to eat.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.000
The tools have changed. The standard has not.
